{"1687190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starlight Explorers", "steam_appid": 1687190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Chart a course for adventure in this lighthearted, all-ages physics sim that will take you to the stars. <br><br>You're Rook, the newest member of the team of Starlight Explorers charting the galaxy and collecting information about planets you pass. Play in three different modes to explore the universe!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Learn about your fellow crew-members in story mode. <br></li><li>Refine mechanics in practice mode. <br></li><li>Show off your skills in expeditions, a long-hauler explorer mode that will challenge you to visit each target location before running out of probes. </li></ul><br>Fun for the whole family: kids get a friendly introduction to gravitational principles; adults get to flex their nav skills. Everyone can set up wild skill shots--then lean back and watch in first-person mode as the galaxy soars by.", "about_the_game": "Chart a course for adventure in this lighthearted, all-ages physics sim that will take you to the stars. <br><br>You're Rook, the newest member of the team of Starlight Explorers charting the galaxy and collecting information about planets you pass. Play in three different modes to explore the universe!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Learn about your fellow crew-members in story mode. <br></li><li>Refine mechanics in practice mode. <br></li><li>Show off your skills in expeditions, a long-hauler explorer mode that will challenge you to visit each target location before running out of probes. </li></ul><br>Fun for the whole family: kids get a friendly introduction to gravitational principles; adults get to flex their nav skills. Everyone can set up wild skill shots--then lean back and watch in first-person mode as the galaxy soars by.", "short_description": "Master physics in one compelling physics puzzle after another. Aim the launcher and adjust it